<html lang='zh-TW'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>會話已被終止</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family:
          'Microsoft JhengHei',
          'PingFang TC',
          -apple-system,
          'Segoe UI',
          sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #1a365d;
        color: white;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }
      .content p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
      .info-box {
        background-color: #f7f8fa;
        border-left: 4px solid #2b6cb0;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .info-box h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #1a365d;
      }
      .info-box ul {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      .info-box li {
        margin: 4px 0;
      }
      .admin-message {
        background-color: #fffbeb;
        border-left: 4px solid #d69e2e;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .admin-message h3 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #744210;
      }
      .footer {
        background-color: #f7f8fa;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
        border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf1;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h2>🔒 您的會話已被終止</h2>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p>{{userName}}，您好：</p>

        <p>您的一個登入會話已被管理員終止。</p>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <h3>會話資訊</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>設備：</strong>{{deviceInfo}}</li>
            {{#if browser}}<li><strong>瀏覽器：</strong>{{browser}}</li>{{/if}}
            {{#if os}}<li><strong>作業系統：</strong>{{os}}</li>{{/if}}
            {{#if ipAddress}}<li><strong>IP 位址：</strong>{{ipAddress}}</li>{{/if}}
            {{#if location}}<li><strong>位置：</strong>{{location}}</li>{{/if}}
            <li><strong>撤銷時間：</strong>{{timestamp}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <h3>撤銷資訊</h3>
          <p style='margin: 0;'><strong>撤銷者：</strong>{{revokedByName}}
            ({{revokedBy}})</p>
          <p style='margin: 4px 0 0;'><strong>原因：</strong>{{reason}}</p>
        </div>

        {{#if customMessage}}
          <div class='admin-message'>
            <h3>📝 管理員訊息</h3>
            <p style='margin: 0;'>{{customMessage}}</p>
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <p>如果這不是您的操作，或您有任何疑問，請立即聯繫支援團隊。</p>
        <p><strong>支援郵箱：</strong><a
            href='mailto:{{supportEmail}}'
            style='color: #2b6cb0;'
          >{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
        <p style='text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;'>
          <a
            href='{{dashboardUrl}}'
            style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background-color: #2b6cb0; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;'
          >前往系統</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>此郵件由系統自動發送，請勿直接回覆。</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 加雲聯網 Intelligent Cloud Plus, Inc. All rights
          reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>